    19	 *      code paths, or downgrade BYPASSRLS code paths to RLS-enforcing ones.
    20	 *
    21	 *   3. The owner pool is request-scoped in spirit — connections are acquired
    22	 *      and released per-call so a single mis-set context can't leak across
