    28	 * Sibling exception: `apps/web/lib/scim/middleware.ts` instantiates `pg.Pool`
    29	 * for the same reason (privileged SCIM token verification path that needs the
    30	 * owner pool the SDK does not export). Treat both modules as the canonical
    31	 * exceptions and prefer the @monopilot/db pools everywhere else.
    32	 */
