     1	-- Migration 016: ALTER tenant_idp_config — add 11 missing F-A2 columns
     2	-- Scope: additive ALTER TABLE only; do NOT modify 005-tenant-idp-config.sql
     3	-- PRD refs: §8.x (Multi-tenant F-A2 columns), §13 (F-U5 password lifecycle)
     4	-- Blocker: Wave-B (T-011/T-012/T-013 depend on these columns)
     5	
